1
00:00:00,287 --> 00:00:02,249
Who owns the sky above your house?

2
00:00:02,821 --> 00:00:05,271
The answer was written in 1944.

3
00:00:06,004 --> 00:00:10,809
Article One of the Chicago Convention:
every State has complete and exclusive

4
00:00:10,829 --> 00:00:13,712
sovereignty over the airspace above its
territory.

5
00:00:14,402 --> 00:00:18,628
That's the land, plus twelve nautical
miles of sea, and everything above it.

6
00:00:19,324 --> 00:00:22,239
And one hundred and ninety-three countries
signed up to it.

7
00:00:22,981 --> 00:00:26,580
For your DGCA exam: Article One equals
sovereignty.

8
00:00:27,301 --> 00:00:28,770
Full lesson on the channel.
